+# ION Agent Branch Capsule Settlement Intake Protocol v0.1
+
+Status: active provisional protocol
+Created: 2026-05-11
+Authority: branch return admissibility and context-settlement intake only
+Production authority: false
+Live execution authority: false
+
+## Purpose
+
+This protocol closes the gap between branch-capsule creation and context
+settlement. A branch may produce useful work, receipts, diffs, and task returns,
+but those outputs are still candidates until the context settler accepts them.
+
+Settlement intake is the read-only gate that decides whether a branch return is
+structurally admissible for review.
+
+```text
+branch capsule
+-> material-work preflight guard
+-> task return / workload diff
+-> settlement intake preflight
+-> context settler review
+-> accepted / conflict / deferred
+```
+
+## Core law
+
+Material branch returns must carry guard evidence.
+
+A settlement packet for material work is not admissible unless it includes:
+
+```text
+branch_identity
+requested_write_scope
+material_work_guard evidence
+workload_diff
+source_refs
+non_claims
+```
+
+The guard evidence must show:
+
+```text
+ok: true
+verdict: ION_AGENT_BRANCH_CAPSULE_READY
+branch identity matches the settlement packet
+requested write scope was declared in the branch
+no shared Capsule/Mini/HOT_CONTEXT/STATUS/ROUTE write
+no agent-assigned C-number
+```
+
+## Non-admissible settlement packets
+
+A context-settlement inbox packet is blocked from intake when it:
+
+```text
+has no branch identity
+has mismatched branch identity
+claims accepted shared state
+writes shared Codex solo context directly
+assigns a C-number/checkpoint directly
+omits material-work guard evidence for material work
+contains guard findings
+omits workload diff for material work
+points source_refs at shared context surfaces as the branch output
+```
+
+## Runtime helper
+
+The runtime helper is:
+
+```text
+ION/04_packages/kernel/ion_agent_branch_capsule.py
+```
+
+It exposes:
+
+```text
+python -m kernel.ion_agent_branch_capsule --ion-root . settlement-intake --packet <SETTLEMENT_PACKET.json>
+```
+
+Optional branch-record cross-check:
+
+```text
+python -m kernel.ion_agent_branch_capsule --ion-root . settlement-intake \
+  --packet <SETTLEMENT_PACKET.json> \
+  --branch-record <BRANCH_RECORD.json>
+```
+
+The command is read-only. It does not merge, promote, write shared context, or
+assign checkpoints.
+
+## Packet shape for material task returns
+
+```json
+{
+  "schema_id": "ion.context_settlement.inbox_packet.v1",
+  "status": "CANDIDATE_PENDING_SETTLEMENT",
+  "source_type": "agent_branch_task_return",
+  "branch_identity": {
+    "context_instance_id": "ctx_...",
+    "branch_id": "branch_...",
+    "conversation_tag": "project_or_session",
+    "agent_tag": "codex_worker",
+    "task_tag": "bounded_task",
+    "parent_context_id": "ctx_shared_codex_solo_current"
+  },
+  "requested_write_scope": [
+    "ION/04_packages/kernel/example.py"
+  ],
+  "material_work_guard": {
+    "schema_id": "ion.agent_branch_capsule.material_work_preflight.v1",
+    "ok": true,
+    "verdict": "ION_AGENT_BRANCH_CAPSULE_READY",
+    "branch_identity": {},
+    "requested_write_scope": [],
+    "findings": []
+  },
+  "workload_diff": {
+    "present": true,
+    "touched_paths": [],
+    "diff_refs": [],
+    "validation_refs": []
+  }
+}
+```
+
+## Settlement outcomes
+
+Settlement intake does not choose the final outcome. It only says whether a
+packet may be reviewed.
+
+Final outcomes remain settler-owned:
+
+```text
+ACCEPTED_AS_WITNESS
+ACCEPTED_AS_CANON
+MERGE_PROPOSAL_REQUIRED
+CONFLICT_RECORDED
+DEFERRED
+REJECTED
+```
+
+## Non-claims
+
+This protocol does not:
+
+```text
+settle branch work
+promote the branch capsule law
+update Capsule/Mini/HOT_CONTEXT/STATUS/ROUTE
+assign a C-number
+run scanners
+reload services
+grant production or live execution authority
+```
+
+## Required next implementation lane
+
+Future work should connect this intake preflight to:
+
+```text
+context_settlement inbox scanner
+branch task-return submitter
+cockpit branch settlement drawer
+Codex queue return contract validation
+automatic conflict packet creation for blocked intake
+```
