+## Settlement intake
+
+Material branch returns must pass the settlement-intake preflight before a
+context settler reviews them.
+
+```bash
+python -m kernel.ion_agent_branch_capsule --ion-root . settlement-intake --packet <SETTLEMENT_PACKET.json>
+```
+
+A material settlement packet must include branch identity, accepted
+material-work guard evidence, requested write scope, and workload diff evidence.
+This is a read-only admissibility check; it does not merge branch output or
+assign C-numbers.
